# The sandbox CA (sandbox/ca/) is generated per machine by `bin/sandbox ca`:
# the private key must never reach the repo, and the certificate is useless
# elsewhere. The folder's README is tracked — only the generated material is
# not, whatever openssl happens to leave next to it (.crt, .key, .srl …).
sandbox/ca/*
!sandbox/ca/README.md

# Python bytecode, e.g. from a local py_compile of the egress's addon.
__pycache__/
*.pyc